      "text": "Day 6 · Breakfast and drive to Santa Rosa de Cabal. At a coffee farm, a local expert guides you through specialty coffee plantations, explaining the whole process from planting and selective hand-picking to pulping; roast beans on a wood stove in a traditional farmhouse kitchen, enjoy the views from bamboo viewpoints, see the drying process and the mill, and finish with a refreshing coffee lemonade. Typical lunch included (5 hours).",
